Now `CompactionSettings.forWindow`:

```dart
factory CompactionSettings.forWindow(int window) {
 // gh-1742 (AC3): proportional headroom — 6.25% of the window, clamped
 // above at 65536 so a 1M window keeps ≥60k headroom (one huge tool
 // result plus estimator drift), and never below the 1024-token summary
 // pricing floor. Monotone in the window: bigger window ⇒ bigger (or
 // equal) reserve. 2000 → 12500, 1048576 → 65536.
 var reserveTokens = min(_maxReserveTokens, max(1024, window ~/ 16));
 // gh-1742: the post-compaction floor scales too (window/8, clamped
 // [2048, 131072]) — the sawtoth restarts proportional to the window
 // instead of always 200 (2% of 1M).
 var keepRecentTokens = min(_maxKeepRecentTokens, max(2048, window ~/ 8));
 // degenerate small windows unchanged
 if (reserveTokens >= window ~/ 2) reserveTokens = max(128, window ~/ 4);
 if (keepRecentTokens >= window) keepRecentTokens = max(256, window ~/ 2);
 return ...;
}
