factory CompactionSettings.forWindow(int window) {
 // gh-1742 (AC3): proportional headroom — 6.25% of the window, clamped
 // above at 65536 so a 1M window keeps ≥60k headroom (one huge tool
 // result plus estimator drift), and never below the 1024-token summary
 // pricing floor. Monotone in the window: bigger window ⇒ bigger (or
