The child loop guard uses `config.model.contextWindow` with `config.contextWindowCap` — the child Agent gets `contextWindowCap: null` presumably (built in task_executor `_buildChild`: Agent(model: wiring.model, ...)). So fixing the wiring model's contextWindow to the registered value fixes the child loop guard too. 

